treewide: make the repository reuse compliant

Every file states its copyright and its license, GPL-3.0-or-later, in an
SPDX header, or in REUSE.toml if it cannot hold a comment, and the text
of the license is in LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt, as the REUSE
specification has it.  The README states the license as well.
